The prior round-3 log names 12 finding IDs, despite the stated count of 13. Its E2 finding contains two separate requirements, so I’ll report those as E2a and E2b. The saved grid JSON confirms 38.69 and 0.90, but its embedded estimand and futility descriptions still describe the old rules.
